  "name": "PostPilot – Generate drafts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PostPilot – Generate drafts\nThe app sends an event brief here. The agent:\n1. reads the brief and the prompt files\n2. writes one post per platform\n3. paints one image\n4. runs a safety check\n\nEvery **Tell app** node sends a progress message to the app, so the audience sees each step live.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a2f2406a-d6fa-e263-af1b-4646a87212a8",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Start\nThe app calls this webhook. We first check the secret header, so only PostPilot can start the agent. Then we load the prompts from the app (they live in the `prompts/` folder).",
