    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One job per platform. The system prompt = rules + brand voice + safety rules + platform rules.\nconst req = $(\"Brief received\").first().json.body;\nconst { prompts, presets } = $(\"Load prompts\").first().json;\nconst system = [prompts[\"draft-system\"], presets[req.preset] ?? \"\", prompts[\"safety-rules\"]].join(\"\\n\\n\");\nreturn req.platforms.map((platform) => ({\n  json: {\n    runId: req.runId,\n    platform,\n    label: platform === \"facebook\" ? \"Facebook\" : \"LinkedIn\",\n    model: req.model,\n    brief: req.brief,\n    organisation: req.organisation,\n    trapPlatform: req.trapPlatform ?? null,\n    trapPrompt: prompts[\"trap\"],\n    messages: [\n      { role: \"system\", content: system + \"\\n\\n\" + prompts[\"platform-\" + platform] },\n      { role: \"user\", content: \"Organisation: \" + req.organisation + \"\\n\\nEvent brief:\\n\" + req.brief },\n    ],\n  },\n}));"
      },
      "id": "28a77d77-4e67-b0ec-77dc-be4a6f711f8e",
      "name": "Prepare drafting jobs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Write one post per platform (loop)\n**One platform at a time** repeats the steps below for Facebook, then LinkedIn.\n- **Draft post with AI** calls OpenRouter.\n- **Check the AI answer** reads the JSON. If it is broken, we **ask again** once, more strictly.\n- **Demo trap**: if switched on in the app, one draft gets a deliberate mistake (wrong date or a fake promise) so the human reviewer can catch it.",
        "width": 2440,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a90ce97d-067b-6427-62d5-d71c787247dc",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1260,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b0412034-feb6-8426-836d-26e5a2423502",
      "name": "One platform at a time",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1320,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.APP_INTERNAL_URL }}/api/internal/runs/{{ $json.runId }}/events",
